{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14221080","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14221080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1422108001:0":{"text":"聞きたいことがある。最近、王都から来た者を通したか？","source_cn":"你最近执勤的时候时有没有放行从王城来到平民区的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C80CC2FBC0EB08E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422108002:0":{"text":"申し上げます！追放された召使い以外、怪しい者は通しておりません！……あっ！そういえば、一人だけ貴族が……","source_cn":"报告大人！除了那些被驱赶出王城的仆从外，绝对没有放行任...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7672B352F88D312","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422108003:0":{"text":"貴族の格好をした子爵を名乗る男が、家の召使いを追っていると言って……怖くて止められませんでした、申し訳ありません……っ！","source_cn":"那个人穿着贵族服饰，说他是一位子爵，正在追赶家里的逃奴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BAE44B29ECC8A7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422108004:0":{"text":"……分かった。持ち場に戻れ。","source_cn":"……知道了，继续执勤吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x012E3FC01E9EB82A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"インドラ","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:大意的卫兵":{"text":"油断している衛兵","source":"大意的卫兵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}